Add the MCXC243 CMake glue and MCXC243VFT pinctrl header to hal_nxp.

The hal_nxp revision pinned by the ZMK Zephyr fork has the MCXC243 device
headers but only stub CMake files for it. The CMake files below are copies of
the MCXC242 ones with the part name changed. The pinctrl header is a backport
of the upstream MCXC243VFT header (same pin mux data as MCXC244VFT), placed in
the dts/nxp/mcx/ layout used by this revision.
Drop this patch once hal_nxp carries real MCXC243 support for the pinned
Zephyr version.

